# Friendly Teddy: "When this creature dies, each player draws a card." Bot1 casts it on turn 1; on turn 2 Bot2 (who has
# drawn Swamp for the turn) Bolts it, and when it dies both players draw: Bot1 the Ornithopter on top of its library,
# Bot2 the Memnite under its turn-two draw. The controller draws as well as the opponent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Friendly Teddy
Plains x4
Ornithopter
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x5
Swamp
Memnite
Swamp x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Friendly Teddy.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Friendly Teddy)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Friendly Teddy
? Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Ornithopter
? Bot2.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Memnite

